<strong>\"Services\"</strong> button and discover how we can create a <strong>masterpiece</strong> together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\">Services</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"backgroundColor\":\"black\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-black-background-color has-background\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"textColor\":\"white\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color\"><strong>Gallery</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery aligncenter has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":17,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\",\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><a href=\"/gallery\"><img src=\"http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/elegant_guitar_floor_cover-1024x680.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-17\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":16,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"/galley\"><img src=\"http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/chill_field_cover-1024x610.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-16\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":14,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"/gallery\"><img src=\"http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/athletic_modeling_cover-1024x682.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-14\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":21,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"gallery\"><img src=\"http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/the_drape_modeling_cover-1024x771.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-21\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":19,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"/gallery\"><img src=\"http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/guitar_cover-1024x685.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-19\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":43,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"/gallery\"><img src=\"http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/63F60606-79C4-4629-8C21-B1EA77C9937D-1024x708.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-43\"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/themes/inspiro/assets/images/StockSnap_89BQZ89TLH.jpg\",\"id\":24,\"hasParallax\":true,\"dimRatio\":40,\"overlayColor\":\"black\",\"minHeight\":375,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"center center\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"is-position-center-center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull has-parallax is-position-center-center\" style=\"min-height:375px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-black-background-color has-background-dim-40 has-background-dim\"></span><div role=\"img\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-24 has-parallax\" style=\"background-position:50% 50%;background-image:url(http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/themes/inspiro/assets/images/StockSnap_89BQZ89TLH.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Write title…\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"lineHeight\":\"1.1\"},\"color\":{\"text\":\"#fffffa\"}},\"fontSize\":\"huge\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-huge-font-size\" style=\"color:#fffffa;line-height:1.1\"><strong>Embark on a Journey of Discovery</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#ffffff;\">Dive into a realm where innovation meets imagination, and every challenge morphs into a learning adventure. Whether it\'s crafting code, creating melodies, or exploring life\'s questions, the journey is all about growing, learning, and transcending boundaries. Let\'s connect, collaborate, and create something extraordinary.</p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"39px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:39px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"textColor\":\"white\",\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-white-color has-text-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/contact\">Contact ME</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->', 'Meet Daniel: Developer, Musician, Athlete, and Beyond', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '9-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-10-14 14:46:27', '2023-10-14 14:46:27', '', 9, 'http://dahandaniel.com/?p=62', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
