(74, 1, '2023-10-14 17:43:48', '2023-10-14 17:43:48', '<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p>Hello! I’m Daniel Dahan, a <strong>modern-day Renaissance man</strong>. With a knack for software development, a heart that beats in rhythm with music, and a body made to move, I venture through life pursuing a symphony of interests. My journey has sculpted me into a <strong>mentor</strong>, an <strong>ex-researcher</strong>, a <strong>model</strong>, and so much more. Each role I’ve embraced has been a note in the composition of my life, contributing to a melody of experiences and knowledge I have today.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"55px\"} -->\n \n<!-- /wp:spacer --><!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#e5e9ec\"}}} -->\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>About me</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p>Dive into a world where code meets chords and intelligence is seasoned with artistic panache. I’m Daniel Dahan - a mentor, a creator, a lifelong learner. Fancy a deeper dive into this blend of tech, tunes, and tales? Hit the \"About Me\" button and let\'s venture beyond the homepage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\",\"orientation\":\"horizontal\"}} -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<a href=\"/about-me\">About ME</a>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- /wp:buttons --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p> </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column -->\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"48px\"} -->\n \n<!-- /wp:spacer --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":34,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure><img src=\"http://dahandaniel.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/80950297-13D4-4FE0-804F-0FC323BA0DE3.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n<!-- /wp:group --><!-